{"diagram":{"image":{"x":0,"width":200,"y":0,"pngdata":"","height":200},"elements":{"leftChildren":[],"comments":[],"children":[{"parent":"root","children":[{"parent":"043e5f55a5537b04","children":[],"style":{"color":"rgb(231,79,76)","font-weight":"bold","font-size":"18px"},"id":"3b7d6f779b370772","title":"在C中，字符串，就是一个特殊的字符数组。&nbsp;<br>以 \\0结尾。&nbsp;"},{"parent":"043e5f55a5537b04","children":[{"parent":"ef7095a6494bb9fe","children":[],"style":{"font-size":"18px"},"id":"39822a09d0b98939","title":"在后期的编程语言设计中，基本都会采用<br>字符数组+额外信息来&nbsp;整体表示一个字符串。&nbsp;<br>比如C++,&nbsp;比如Java。&nbsp;"}],"collapsed":false,"style":{"font-size":"18px"},"id":"ef7095a6494bb9fe","title":"C里面的字符串设计不是特别好。<br>问题1：&nbsp;字符串本身无法存储 \\0&nbsp;&nbsp;<br>问题2：&nbsp;每一次看字符串的长度，都要遍历一遍字符数组"}],"style":{"font-size":"18px"},"id":"043e5f55a5537b04","title":"什么是字符串"},{"parent":"root","children":[{"parent":"6696ef000bddebad","children":[],"style":{"font-size":"18px"},"id":"df578e245057a73a","title":"我们平时使用的双引号引起来的，就是字符串字面值"},{"parent":"6696ef000bddebad","children":[{"parent":"b8236ad212847dc6","children":[],"style":{"font-size":"18px"},"id":"f9e9c55ac4920b2b","title":"第一种写法一定要知道。&nbsp;<br>\"hello world\""}],"style":{"font-size":"18px"},"id":"b8236ad212847dc6","title":"写法"},{"parent":"6696ef000bddebad","children":[{"parent":"f484d8bf758ced8f","children":[],"style":{"color":"rgb(231,79,76)","font-weight":"bold","font-size":"18px"},"id":"754dc712a09cf926","title":"存储一个叫做只读数据段上的区域。&nbsp;特点就是<br>只读<br>生命周期静态生命周期（活的够久）"},{"parent":"f484d8bf758ced8f","children":[],"style":{"color":"rgb(231,79,76)","font-weight":"bold","font-size":"18px"},"id":"cecebe4cb32e99f7","title":"还是以&nbsp;字符数组的形式存的。以 \\0结尾的"}],"style":{"font-weight":"bold","font-size":"18px"},"id":"f484d8bf758ced8f","title":"存储位置"},{"parent":"6696ef000bddebad","children":[{"parent":"ffc51783458bdd80","children":[],"style":{"font-size":"18px"},"id":"81d3dfe29e95138b","title":"一般是在printf的时候传入。这时候，字符串字面值其实退化成了首指针。<br>它怎么知道这个数组多长？<br>直接是往后找，找到 \\0&nbsp;认为终止"},{"parent":"ffc51783458bdd80","children":[{"parent":"5b0d82bdc5bdec41","children":[],"style":{"font-size":"18px"},"id":"f1983ddc5b9191ae","title":"char *p = \"hello\";"},{"parent":"5b0d82bdc5bdec41","children":[],"style":{"font-size":"18px"},"id":"4d4c2c88a540eb89","title":"但是需要注意的点是：&nbsp;使用指针接收，指针指向的内存是只读数据段上的区域。<br>换句话说，就是我们不能通过这个指针去修改这个数据。"}],"collapsed":false,"style":{"font-size":"18px"},"id":"5b0d82bdc5bdec41","title":"使用指针接收"}],"collapsed":false,"style":{"font-size":"18px"},"id":"ffc51783458bdd80","title":"字符串字面值的操作"}],"collapsed":false,"style":{"font-size":"18px"},"id":"6696ef000bddebad","title":"字符串字面值"},{"parent":"root","children":[{"parent":"7bcf64cd5b25fe79","children":[{"parent":"7d84a64c5e46221d","children":[],"style":{"font-size":"18px"},"id":"c47959dffa5d1b70","title":"因为C中的字符串，就是字符数组。所以声明字符串，就是声明字符数组。&nbsp;<br>区别就是我们声明的字符数组，应该注意一下 +1就行。&nbsp;<br>比如，现在要存储长度最多80的字符串，声明字符数组长度应该 80+1"},{"parent":"7d84a64c5e46221d","children":[],"style":{"font-size":"18px"},"id":"42b9e0b8c907440f","title":"char str[80+1];<br>char *str2;<br>//&nbsp;后面这种声明需要注意一下。&nbsp;这个指针不能直接用，需要指向有效的内存"}],"style":{"font-size":"18px"},"id":"7d84a64c5e46221d","title":"声明"},{"parent":"7bcf64cd5b25fe79","children":[{"parent":"f67dc001138ae66b","children":[],"style":{"font-size":"18px"},"id":"3b36c09e79afab76","title":"char str[] = \"hello\";<br>// 上述代码等价于<br>char str2[] = {'h', 'e', 'l', 'l', 'o', '\\0'};<br>这是一种语法糖，只是一个简写形式"},{"parent":"f67dc001138ae66b","children":[],"style":{"font-size":"18px"},"id":"13d8a43bbadbe617","title":"其他的初始化形式都比较简单。&nbsp;<br>要注意给 \\0&nbsp;留个位置就可以了<br>"},{"parent":"f67dc001138ae66b","children":[{"parent":"9581b0cc562dffb4","children":[],"style":{"font-size":"18px"},"id":"70ec9dade9e5bcd3","title":"第一种写法是个语法糖，会在栈上申请内存。换句话说，它里面的数据可以修改"},{"parent":"9581b0cc562dffb4","children":[],"style":{"font-size":"18px"},"id":"f002592b826036ec","title":"第二种是一个指针，指针指向只读数据段。所以，指针指向的这片内存无法修改，一修改就报错"}],"collapsed":false,"style":{"font-size":"18px"},"id":"9581b0cc562dffb4","title":"char str[] = \"Showmaker\";<br>char *p = \"Showmaker\";<br>这两种写法有这本质的区别"}],"style":{"font-size":"18px"},"id":"f67dc001138ae66b","title":"初始化"},{"parent":"7bcf64cd5b25fe79","children":[{"parent":"660a15bc85f31845","children":[{"parent":"e66a0d11b3c48e86","children":[{"parent":"7420b0957bb1c247","children":[],"id":"0ef3f6faa77a8e68","title":"建议使用 while循环。&nbsp;for可以"}],"collapsed":false,"style":{"font-size":"18px"},"id":"7420b0957bb1c247","title":"char str[] = \"hello world!\";<br>for (int i = 0; str[i] != '\\0'; i++) {<br>&nbsp; &nbsp; printf(\"%c\\n\", str[i]);<br>}<br>"},{"parent":"e66a0d11b3c48e86","children":[],"style":{"font-size":"18px"},"id":"a00a6bfd7b8ace73","title":"char* p = str;<br>while (*p != '\\0') {&nbsp; &nbsp; // 等价于 *p != 0，即字符不是空字符就继续遍历<br>&nbsp; &nbsp; printf(\"%c\\n\", *p++);<br>}"},{"parent":"e66a0d11b3c48e86","children":[],"style":{"font-size":"18px"},"id":"10f6c73a81d52e74","title":"printf(\"%s\\n\", str);<br>puts(str);"},{"parent":"e66a0d11b3c48e86","children":[{"parent":"c287c92ded569cff","children":[],"style":{"font-weight":"bold","font-size":"18px"},"id":"f4906b71514e5710","title":"需要注意，要么挪指针，要么直接偏移<br>不要一边挪指针，一边偏移"}],"collapsed":false,"style":{"color":"rgb(231,79,76)","font-weight":"bold","font-size":"18px"},"id":"c287c92ded569cff","title":"推荐使用while循环。且一定要会<br>因为遍历操作很常见"}],"collapsed":false,"style":{"font-size":"18px"},"id":"e66a0d11b3c48e86","title":"遍历/往屏幕输出"},{"parent":"660a15bc85f31845","children":[{"parent":"af8a66051069547c","children":[{"parent":"531a621b7486ed52","children":[],"style":{"font-size":"18px"},"id":"6ddaf5f038723f9d","title":"不安全，也就是录入的字符串太长了。<br>会全部录进来"},{"parent":"531a621b7486ed52","children":[],"style":{"font-size":"18px"},"id":"b307f26c96996d0d","title":"scanf(\"%9s\",arr);<br>最多存储9个，第10个存零字符"}],"collapsed":false,"style":{"font-size":"18px"},"id":"531a621b7486ed52","title":"scanf(\"%s\", arr);<br>输入一个字符串，存储到arr。<br>"}],"collapsed":false,"style":{"font-size":"18px"},"id":"af8a66051069547c","title":"输入"}],"collapsed":false,"style":{"font-size":"18px"},"id":"660a15bc85f31845","title":"字符串的输出和输入"}],"collapsed":false,"style":{"font-size":"18px"},"id":"7bcf64cd5b25fe79","title":"字符串变量"},{"parent":"root","children":[{"parent":"82b676184d452b87","children":[],"style":{"font-size":"18px"},"id":"f15f875ae40020d4","title":"C里面的字符串是字符数组存储的，有一些操作是普遍的，<br>比如求字符串长度，比如比较两个字符串是否相等。<br>字符串库简单说就是一系列函数，帮助我们更方便的操作字符串"},{"parent":"82b676184d452b87","children":[{"parent":"5e776b68e9cea8dc","children":[],"style":{"font-size":"18px"},"id":"764ed5abc8ab9ea9","title":"计算字符串长度"},{"parent":"5e776b68e9cea8dc","children":[],"style":{"font-size":"18px"},"id":"f71dbd4d4015fa2c","title":"size_t strlen(const char *s);"},{"parent":"5e776b68e9cea8dc","children":[],"style":{"font-size":"18px"},"id":"62c561663a5a4719","title":"传入的地址应该是一个字符串（以空字符结尾），否则会产生越界访问，未定义行为。&nbsp;"},{"parent":"5e776b68e9cea8dc","children":[{"parent":"a6ae1dda834793af","children":[],"style":{"font-size":"18px"},"id":"a4dfe227d2baedb4","title":"char str[10] = \"hello\";"},{"parent":"a6ae1dda834793af","children":[],"style":{"font-size":"18px"},"id":"70db53fa34d7a5ed","title":"sizeof用于计算某个位置占用多少大小。比如传数组，得到的是数组占用的大小空间。"},{"parent":"a6ae1dda834793af","children":[],"style":{"font-size":"18px"},"id":"96ba798022f7cb93","title":"strlen用于计算一个字符串长度，计算的是从头到空字符的长度。"},{"parent":"a6ae1dda834793af","children":[],"style":{"font-weight":"bold","font-size":"18px"},"id":"245a5263bd7d3e30","title":"面试一般问：&nbsp;难点、易混淆的点"}],"collapsed":false,"style":{"color":"rgb(231,79,76)","font-weight":"bold","font-size":"18px"},"id":"a6ae1dda834793af","title":"sizeof和strlen区别要知道"},{"parent":"5e776b68e9cea8dc","children":[{"parent":"242d0e72d9ba9ff4","children":[],"style":{"font-size":"18px"},"id":"8de1f1275c0f5c10","title":"如果一种写法没有明显的好处，但是又有明显的坏处。<br>不太建议"}],"collapsed":false,"style":{"font-size":"18px"},"id":"242d0e72d9ba9ff4","title":"要自己能实现strlen"}],"collapsed":false,"style":{"font-size":"18px"},"id":"5e776b68e9cea8dc","title":"strlen"},{"parent":"82b676184d452b87","children":[{"parent":"44704ad5f60ea1bc","children":[],"style":{"font-size":"18px"},"id":"34976cb44469d2a7","title":"完成字符串的复制"},{"parent":"44704ad5f60ea1bc","children":[],"style":{"font-size":"18px"},"id":"92385ecad7169b11","title":"这个是直接就是复制，不关心能否存下"},{"parent":"44704ad5f60ea1bc","children":[{"parent":"ace45fb388daa693","children":[],"style":{"font-size":"18px"},"id":"684cf3f1a575d943","title":"最多复制n个字符"},{"parent":"ace45fb388daa693","children":[],"style":{"font-size":"18px"},"id":"0230edc2ee7c4921","title":"如果n比较小，比 strlen(src) +1&nbsp;小。只复制n个"},{"parent":"ace45fb388daa693","children":[],"style":{"font-size":"18px"},"id":"c5c8cf9d783e3b71","title":"如果n比较巧，刚好等于 strlen(src) + 1。 也复制n个"},{"parent":"ace45fb388daa693","children":[],"style":{"font-size":"18px"},"id":"c2b28583f527d358","title":"如果n比较大，比&nbsp; strlen(src) + 1,&nbsp; 前面的数据拷贝过来，后面填 '\\0'"},{"parent":"ace45fb388daa693","children":[],"style":{"font-size":"18px"},"id":"cd755ca0354b9151","title":"n的建议： sizeof(dest)-1<br>dest[sizeof(dest)-1] = '\\0'&nbsp;"}],"style":{"font-size":"18px"},"id":"ace45fb388daa693","title":"strncpy:&nbsp;是一个更安全的字符串复制函数"}],"collapsed":false,"style":{"font-size":"18px"},"id":"44704ad5f60ea1bc","title":"strcpy"},{"parent":"82b676184d452b87","children":[{"parent":"4f1fa1f28f185608","children":[],"style":{"font-size":"18px"},"id":"a734a341848b1815","title":"完成字符串的拼接"},{"parent":"4f1fa1f28f185608","children":[],"style":{"font-size":"18px"},"id":"e9f368c7d64ec944","title":"将src表示的字符串，拼接到dest的后面。<br>也就是从dest的 \\0位置开始覆盖。直到结束"},{"parent":"4f1fa1f28f185608","children":[{"parent":"3ebcc4d444fe5011","children":[],"style":{"font-size":"18px"},"id":"21cd963b67a84254","title":"有两种情况会终止：要么复制到了n个字符"},{"parent":"3ebcc4d444fe5011","children":[],"style":{"font-size":"18px"},"id":"d5e59423b64e2ce5","title":"要么复制到了src的末尾"},{"parent":"3ebcc4d444fe5011","children":[],"style":{"color":"rgb(231,79,76)","font-weight":"bold","font-size":"18px"},"id":"e720c9d2a360e88d","title":"最终一定会补一个 \\0"},{"parent":"3ebcc4d444fe5011","children":[],"style":{"font-size":"18px"},"id":"9d6356716923ceea","title":"建议的n: sizeof(dest) - strlen(dest) -1"}],"style":{"font-size":"18px"},"id":"3ebcc4d444fe5011","title":"strncat:&nbsp;更安全的cat函数<br>concat:&nbsp;拼接"}],"collapsed":false,"style":{"font-size":"18px"},"id":"4f1fa1f28f185608","title":"strcat"},{"parent":"82b676184d452b87","children":[{"parent":"856f25eced4d77b4","children":[],"id":"2574d886fa56ccf2","title":"compare:&nbsp;就是比较两个字符串是否相等。&nbsp;<br>"},{"parent":"856f25eced4d77b4","children":[{"parent":"df8f645894302160","children":[],"id":"dfa3f3ac491a8303","title":"字典序"}],"collapsed":false,"id":"df8f645894302160","title":"字符串怎么叫相等"}],"collapsed":false,"id":"856f25eced4d77b4","title":"strcmp"}],"collapsed":false,"style":{"font-size":"18px"},"id":"82b676184d452b87","title":"字符串库"},{"parent":"root","children":[{"parent":"e96a32f6b8484ab2","children":[],"id":"2b46cfd80085c9d4","title":"研究的是有一组字符串如何存储的问题"},{"parent":"e96a32f6b8484ab2","children":[{"parent":"12c9cf095729cbfd","children":[{"parent":"8546af3198591c63","children":[],"id":"3141b86122aa2788","title":"了解一下就行"},{"parent":"8546af3198591c63","children":[],"id":"59b63c8f691e1a3e","title":"如果有一个字符串太长，则其他的都要这么长。换句话说，有大量空间浪费"}],"id":"8546af3198591c63","title":"二维字符数组"},{"parent":"12c9cf095729cbfd","children":[{"parent":"5c8d99a6381ecc0a","children":[],"id":"3726763332b7074c","title":"单个字符串是字符数组，我们可以用一个指针指向它。==》单个字符串可以用指针表示。<br>一组字符串，可以使用指针数组（是数组，数组里每个元素都是指针）。来存储"}],"style":{"color":"rgb(231,79,76)","font-weight":"bold"},"id":"5c8d99a6381ecc0a","title":"指针数组<br>"}],"id":"12c9cf095729cbfd","title":"两种存储方式"}],"id":"e96a32f6b8484ab2","title":"字符串数组"},{"parent":"root","children":[{"parent":"7a31dbe5bb70ef20","children":[],"id":"832819c414cdfd30","title":"字符串数组的一个实际案例。"},{"parent":"7a31dbe5bb70ef20","children":[],"id":"46525c5b70daded4","title":"有时候，是允许你运行时给一些参数的。在程序内部，需要接收这个参数，这时候就是使用的字符串数组"},{"parent":"7a31dbe5bb70ef20","children":[{"parent":"e080add2f14de873","children":[],"id":"6ed1f28aab9b2a3f","title":"系统会将你给的输入，处理好，处理成指针数组，并且将数据给你。"},{"parent":"e080add2f14de873","children":[],"id":"d67f76d7f6468dbe","title":"我们需要知道接收的格式。&nbsp;就是第一个参数是什么含义，第二个参数是什么含义即可"}],"style":{"font-weight":"bold"},"id":"e080add2f14de873","title":"关于这块，知道两件事"}],"id":"7a31dbe5bb70ef20","title":"命令行参数"},{"parent":"root","children":[{"parent":"5019dfdc3a481f80","children":[],"id":"1b906e00fa2a52cc","title":"就是将一些数据放在一个类型中。让这个一个类型能存放多个数据"},{"parent":"5019dfdc3a481f80","children":[{"parent":"fd0712d7854d7045","children":[],"id":"c1b9b15afe028b9f","title":"定义一个类型。这个类型就类似于int"}],"id":"fd0712d7854d7045","title":"结构体的定义"},{"parent":"5019dfdc3a481f80","children":[{"parent":"a30835f2ec16e60c","children":[],"id":"3250641825d6807d","title":"struct&nbsp;结构体名&nbsp;结构体变量名;<br>int&nbsp; num; //&nbsp;类似。&nbsp;只是要写struct"},{"parent":"a30835f2ec16e60c","children":[],"id":"48c02d90f18bd17f","title":"如果想不加struct。&nbsp;要用类型别名。&nbsp;名称区分一下。&nbsp;使用大驼峰"}],"id":"a30835f2ec16e60c","title":"声明结构体"},{"parent":"5019dfdc3a481f80","children":[{"parent":"7a77e3cf1c7ef214","children":[],"id":"8c7f3de6c2d77289","title":"给结构体对象中的值赋值。"},{"parent":"7a77e3cf1c7ef214","children":[],"id":"b48c972befabef39","title":"如果全部赋值，挨个赋进去<br>如果赋了部分，&nbsp;后面就是0值"}],"id":"7a77e3cf1c7ef214","title":"初始结构体"},{"parent":"5019dfdc3a481f80","children":[{"parent":"2cbc888f04992d1a","children":[],"id":"2f5f9814ae08356a","title":"为了保证访问数据的高效，结构体这块存在一个对齐。&nbsp;简单说，就是凑4字节的整数。<br>怎么凑，不重要；&nbsp;重要的是要知道有这个对齐；<br>后续计算结构体大小，使用sizeof()&nbsp;不要自己加"}],"id":"2cbc888f04992d1a","title":"数据对齐"}],"id":"5019dfdc3a481f80","title":"结构体"},{"parent":"root","children":[],"id":"a91890e42980510b","title":"枚举"}],"root":true,"theme":"{\"background\":\"#ffffff\",\"title\":\"基础曲线\",\"startType\":[],\"marginH\":24,\"marginW\":50,\"childMarginH\":24,\"childMarginW\":16,\"common\":{\"family\":\"微软雅黑\",\"italic\":false,\"textAlign\":\"left\"},\"connectionStyle\":{\"lineWidth\":2,\"lineColor\":\"#8A8A8A\",\"color\":\"#ffffff\"},\"centerTopic\":{\"backgroundColor\":\"#00A59A\",\"color\":\"#fff\",\"font-size\":\"20px\",\"border-radius\":\"12px\",\"padding\":\"13px 20px\",\"font-weight\":\"normal\",\"font-family\":\"微软雅黑\",\"font-style\":\"normal\"},\"secTopic\":{\"backgroundColor\":\"#EEEEEE\",\"border-radius\":\"10px\",\"color\":\"#0D0D0DE5\",\"font-size\":\"18px\",\"padding\":\"8px 14px\",\"lineStyle\":{\"lineType\":\"curve\",\"lineWidth\":2,\"lineColor\":\"#484848\"},\"font-family\":\"微软雅黑\",\"font-weight\":\"normal\",\"font-style\":\"normal\"},\"childTopic\":{\"font-size\":\"16px\",\"color\":\"#0D0D0DE5\",\"padding\":\"3px 12px\",\"font-weight\":\"normal\",\"lineStyle\":{\"lineType\":\"roundBroken\",\"lineWidth\":2,\"lineColor\":\"#484848\"},\"font-family\":\"微软雅黑\",\"font-style\":\"normal\",\"border-radius\":\"30px\"},\"id\":\"customise_efe174d4bfb5\"}","showWatermark":false,"style":{"font-size":"18px"},"id":"root","title":"Day08_字符串","version":426,"structure":"mind"}},"meta":{"exportTime":"2025-05-14 21:32:43","member":"","diagramInfo":{"creator":"","created":"","modified":"","title":"","category":""},"id":"","type":"ProcessOn Schema File","version":"1.0"}}